# Theme: Hogwarts
# A school of wizards: Harry Potter characters by temperament.
# Fan theme. Character names belong to their owners; claude-sabha is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.
Vidur|Hedwig|#8A6D3B|Owl post: delivers your words and replies, and never does the work.
Yudhishthira|McGonagall|#2E6B3A|Stern, fair, and sorts each brief into the right house.
Bhishma|Dumbledore|#6B4FA3|Plans ten moves ahead and twinkles when you ask why.
Bhima|Hagrid|#8B4A2B|Hauls the biggest builds over his shoulder, no questions asked.
Arjun|Harry|#B22222|Seeker's aim: one precise grab for the Snitch, build after build.
Sahadev|Hermione|#C77D1E|Reads every line, and corrects your homework in the margin.
Nakul|Luna|#5FA8B0|Writes dreamy docs that somehow turn out accurate.
Karna|Fred|#D1601F|Runs the tests with a bang and reports the carnage.
Sanjaya|Skeeter|#9B3D7D|Quick-Quotes Quill: writes down every decision, no embellishing.
Duryodhan|Snape|#3F5A47|Sneers at your backend until the potion is brewed right.
Dushasan|Draco|#6C7A89|Picky about style; sneers at pixels that are out of place.
Shakuni|Moody|#7A5C2E|Constant vigilance: thinks like a dark wizard to catch one.
Draupadi|Umbridge|#C2547A|Issues decrees on scope; anything beyond the form is declined.
Gandhari|Trelawney|#8F6AAE|Reviews with no context, and sees visions of bugs anyway.
VedVyasa|Pince|#7E5A3C|Guards the library records and glares at anyone who loses one.
Barbarika|Nick|#6F8FAF|Nearly Headless ghost: drifts, watches, and passes through walls.
Abhimanyu|Dobby|#A8893B|A free elf who tidies up the mess and asks for no thanks.
Krishna|Lupin|#4C7A8C|Patient teacher who explains it again, kindly, until it clicks.
Ashwatthama|Filch|#5E6B3A|Patrols the corridors after hours for anything the merge broke.
Dronacharya|Flitwick|#3D5FA0|Dueling champion who drills the agents' prompts to perfection.
